   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Sept 19th Triple X Love! Love!**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Terror Song (Furniture Huschle cover)**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2003-04-09.aud.256mp3** (recommended): audience recording; 17 songs; 58 min [1]\n- **2003-04-09-sbd-the-mountain-goats-wills-pub-orlando-fl**: soundboard; 17 songs; 54 min [2]. Said about its sound: Pre-show music is audible during the first song and gets switched off after John asks what it is [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Thermals were the opening act for this show [2]\n- The uploader played air hockey against Darnielle before the show and says he won several rounds [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **2003-04-09-sbd-the-mountain-goats-wills-pub-orlando-fl**: taped by damorecordo [2]",
